00:23:34.940 --> 00:23:40.350
and CEO of Navvis, a powerful
platform for the digital twin

00:23:40.350 --> 00:23:42.540
for indoor applications.

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:48.350
Thank you very much for
flying over to San Francisco.

00:23:48.350 --> 00:23:51.590
And last but not least,
we have Moritz Tenorth,

00:23:51.590 --> 00:23:56.150
CTO of Magazino, that builds
