00:23:56.150 --> 00:23:58.910
collaborative robots
for internal logistics

00:23:58.910 --> 00:24:02.840
with particular focus on
mobile picking robots.

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:06.000
Thank you very much.

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:10.130
We have one chair too much.

00:24:10.130 --> 00:24:12.920
Thanks, you guys, hope
you had a good trip.

00:24:12.920 --> 00:24:16.160
Thanks for coming here and
sharing your experiences

00:24:16.160 --> 00:24:20.870
to that audience on the
cloud automation platform.

00:24:20.870 --> 00:24:26.990
I want to get us started by
asking the same question to all

00:24:26.990 --> 00:24:29.400
